OL,3,ACeline Dion kicks off Paris Fashion
OL,4,AWeek with surprise performance
OL,5,
OL,6,FCeline Dion has opened Paris Fashion
OL,7,FWeek with a surprise performance of her
OL,8,F2002 hit I'm Alive, underneath the
OL,9,Fcity's famous Eiffel Tower.
OL,11,FThe Canadian star, who was diagnosed
OL,12,Fwith a rare neurological disease called
OL,13,Fstiff person syndrome in 2022, took to
OL,14,Fthe runway at the end of L'Oreal's
OL,15,Fannual show.
OL,17,FThe singer, who wore a ruched
OL,18,Ffull-length velvet black gown, was
OL,19,Flater joined by famous ambassadors for
OL,20,Fthe French brand, including Viola
OL,21,FDavis, Simone Ashley, Aja Naomi King
OL,22,Fand Eva Longoria.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
